    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG Begley are delighted to present the show house at The Meadows, Dún an Rí, Coosan, Athlone, to the market. This beautifully presented three-bedroom home offers prospective purchasers the opportunity to experience the quality, layout and finish of these impressive new homes firsthand.\n\nThe property comprises a welcoming entrance hall, a bright and spacious open-plan kitchen and living area, three well-proportioned bedrooms, two bathrooms and a convenient guest WC. Designed with modern family living in mind, the home combines practical accommodation with contemporary finishes and an abundance of natural light.\n\nLocated in the established and highly regarded Dún an Rí development in Coosan, The Meadows offers a desirable setting close to Athlone town centre, Lough Ree and a range of local amenities, schools and recreational facilities.\n\nViewing of the show house is highly recommended to anyone interested in the development to appreciate the standard of accommodation and the lifestyle on offer. Whether you are a first-time buyer, looking to trade up or seeking a modern home in an excellent, well-connected location, this is an excellent opportunity to explore what The Meadows, Dún an Rí has to offer.\n\nContact DNG Begley today to arrange your viewing."
      },
